{"t":"Blooming Griffinclaw","s":"blooming-griffinclaw-39ffc","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Blooming_Griffinclaw_d1604c.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Blooming Griffinclaw</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Blooming Griffinclaw\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blooming_Griffinclaw_d1604c.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flora and Minerals<br/>Flowers<br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #006600; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20080806050619&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blooming_Griffinclaw_d1604c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a blooming griffinclaw.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>One on top of the mountains of <a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor\">Nargor</a>; four in <a href=\"#/wiki/Deathbine\">Deathbine</a>'s lair; five deep inside <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>; one in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Caverna%20Exanima\">Caverna Exanima</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33500,32276,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33500, 32276, 10)</a>, only accessible during a quest mission).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When it is not blooming, it becomes a <a href=\"#/wiki/Griffinclaw%20%28Dry%29\">Dry Griffinclaw</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Griffinclaw%20%28Dry%29\"><img alt=\"Dry Griffinclaw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Griffinclaw_Dry_41eb10.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>. Only the flower growing on Nargor can be harvested. You can take a sample of it every 20 hours, as long as you have an empty container at hand and haven't handed one in yet. If you try to harvest it again before the 20 hours are over, you will receive the following message: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You just collected a fragile griffinclaw. At least wait for the rest of the plant to recover a bit before gathering more.</span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>To take a sample of this plant, use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Botanist%27s%20Container\">Botanist's Container</a> on it while it is blooming. A sample cannot be taken when it is <a href=\"#/wiki/Griffinclaw%20%28Dry%29\">dry</a>.\n<ul><li>This sample is needed to obtain the <a href=\"#/quest/druid-outfits-quest\">Druid's Bear/Wolf Fur Addon</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Note you must have begun this quest yourself to obtain the plant piece. You cannot use a different character.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_get_to_the_Griffinclaw_Flower_on_Nargor\">How to get to the Griffinclaw Flower on Nargor</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Griffinclaw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Griffinclaw_f3fd32.jpg\" width=\"337\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>From entrance at Nargor, walk from A to B, go up stairs.</li>\n<li>Walk from C to D, use three <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> (exani hur up) to go up at D.</li>\n<li>Walk from E to F, there are multiple <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">Pirates</a> in this area, so be careful if you are a lower level.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/druid-outfits-quest\">Druid Outfits Quest</a></li><li>Flora and Minerals</li><li>Flowers</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Griffinclaw%20%28Dry%29\">Griffinclaw (Dry)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Griffinclaw%20Container\">Griffinclaw Container</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcel</a></li><li>Remains</li><li>Repeatable Tasks</li><li>Status Effects</li><li>Trembling Effect</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["druid-outfits-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"druid-outfits-quest","quest":"Druid Outfits Quest","step":"1-3","n":6,"title":"Recolher a amostra","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":33500,"y":32276,"z":10,"text":"One on top of the mountains of Nargor ; four in Deathbine 's lair; five deep inside Chyllfroest ; one in the Caverna Exanima ( here , only accessible during a quest mission)."}]}}